# Example environment for apps/web (copy to .env.local; never commit real values).
# This file lists names only. Started in P11 (11-22); earlier variables are documented in
# docs/ops/hosting.md and the GO-LIVE list.

# Web Push (11-22, DASH-34). All three set = real Web Push; any missing = the logged fake
# sender (nothing leaves the server). Generate a pair with `npx web-push generate-vapid-keys`.
# VAPID_SUBJECT must be mailto: or https: (never localhost). The private key is server-only;
# only the public key reaches the browser (passed as a prop, never NEXT_PUBLIC_).
VAPID_SUBJECT=
VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
